  "content": "<h3><a href=\"https://discord.gg/QZUJtsbkcY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入 Discord，与我和其他玩家交流关于 Minecraft 的话题</a></h3>\n<h2><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kD11hZu.png\" alt=\"\"> 概述 <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kD11hZu.png\" alt=\"\"></h2>\n<p>此数据包旨在添加符合常识的新内容，例如染料混合或台阶与方块的转换。Minecraft 的合成配方需要一次革新，而本模组正是为此而生。</p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/A8bTUqW.png\" alt=\"\"> 功能特性 <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/A8bTUqW.png\" alt=\"\"></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><em>访问<a href=\"https://github.com/GenMode/Minecraft/wiki/Recipes-Plus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">维基页面</a>获取更多信息</em></li>\n</ul>\n<h4>合成配方：</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>20 多种染料相关配方</li>\n<li>100 多种切石机配方</li>\n<li>盔甲架、画作和置物架的改良</li>\n<li>锁子甲合成配方</li>\n<li>珊瑚漂白与复活</li>\n<li>鞘翅强化</li>\n<li>花朵复制</li>\n<li>马铠与鹦鹉螺壳护甲合成配方</li>\n<li>冰块合成配方</li>\n<li>陶器碎片复制</li>\n<li>资源回收</li>\n<li>楼梯变台阶，台阶变方块</li>\n<li>木材切割</li>\n<li>更多未列出的配方</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/genmodetwitch/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iDr8VZZ.png\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/QZUJtsbkcY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/piRrcB9.png\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgenart_\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ef4dzPQ.png\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fGenMode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rM4omea.png\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/GenMedia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sd7OOwy.png\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fgen%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zxvVF9e.png\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsmithed.net%252fGenMode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/r6J6uxq.jpeg\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/DatapackGen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oMlE5pH.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
